{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen."}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport","text":"RejectionReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker checks each event’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"constraintViolation()"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything else, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rejected event is never enriched, held by a consent, written to a store or delivered. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record a store recovered is checked too, and one rejected is forgotten by the store. In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"debug builds each rejection is also logged at error level."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a rejection joins the waiting report of the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event, property and keyword, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reports waiting unread are at most one per constraint the app declares, however many events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"break them. Copies of a tracker share one sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker has finished. A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","type":"reference"},{"text":" tracker’s is empty.","type":"text"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports"},"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L214"},"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV16rejectionReportsScSyAA15RejectionReportVGvp","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"rejectionReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","text":"AsyncStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","text":"RejectionReport"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"symbolKind":"property","title":"rejectionReports","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/records-swift.property":{"role":"symbol","title":"records","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"tex